    "body": "I enthusiastically support this proposal! I just switched Tableau's internal UI library over to use `:focus-visible` and am now playing whack-a-mole with a bunch of edge cases that this would solve. For example https://github.com/WICG/focus-visible/issues/268\r\n\r\nIMO we should also expose the current \"focus-visibility\" as a property in `FocusEvent`, alongside.",
